{"id":"wb-2-38","name":"太和宫金殿","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"太和宫金殿","text":"太和宫金殿又称昆明金殿，位于云南省昆明市东北郊鸣凤山麓，距离中心城区约7千米，是中华人民共和国境内现存规模最大、保存最完整的纯铜铸殿，为全国四大铜殿之一。1982年2月，该文物被国务院公布为第二批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%AA%E5%92%8C%E5%AE%AB%E9%87%91%E6%AE%BF","revisionId":93553705,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93553705","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/548711f0e3fb00ab423dc35f.jpg","title":"昆明太和宫金殿.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%98%86%E6%98%8E%E5%A4%AA%E5%92%8C%E5%AE%AB%E9%87%91%E6%AE%BF.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d2/%E6%98%86%E6%98%8E%E5%A4%AA%E5%92%8C%E5%AE%AB%E9%87%91%E6%AE%BF.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Gisling","license":"CC BY 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0","caption":"​昆明太和宫金殿","width":320,"height":240}}